# Drop-zone for full-resolution drone photos before optimization (see
# scripts in public/gallery/regatta-2025/ for the resize pipeline).
/gallery/

# Supplier 3D-asset drop folder. Contains raw deliverables (zips, OBJs,
# 4K texture PNGs, Unity scripts) that are too large for the repo. Only
# the GLBs we actually ship live in public/models/. To share the rest
# with the V3 simulator / Mobile lanes, hand off the zip directly.
/3d/

# Drop-zone for high-res poster source PNGs (RU + EN infographics).
# Optimized JPEG copies live in public/anatomy/posters/ - the originals
# at 2-3 MB each are too heavy for the repo.
/grafics/
/graphics/
